{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-853f4dcc16af","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-853f4dcc16af","name":"水煮玉米","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E6%B0%B4%E7%85%AE%E7%8E%89%E7%B1%B3.md","blob_sha":"d6f46391d75e2fc662eba8023b2d6f4fbaeac178","details":{"introduction":"水煮玉米是一道家常快手菜，口感清甜软糯。新鲜玉米带皮煮制，保留原香，加入盐和糖更能提味。它富含膳食纤维、维生素与碳水化合物，能为身体提供饱足感。做法极其简单，新手也能轻松上手，从准备到上桌只需大约 15 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 新鲜玉米\n- 放得下玉米的锅\n- 水\n- 盐\n- 糖（可选）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 一个带皮玉米\n- 淹过玉米约半节指头的水\n- 煮玉米的时候，开始和淡盐水，差不多 2 克盐加 50ml 的水\n- 根据口味选择加或者不加糖（可选）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将新鲜玉米剥去外皮，剩部分玉米皮入锅\n2. 加入淹过玉米约半节指头的水，加盐和糖\n3. 水煮开之后转至小火，加盖继续煮 15-20 分钟，玉米煮久点没事。\n4. 煮熟后沥干水分，冷却后食用。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"按水煮黄色甜玉米粒参考，不含玉米芯；糯玉米不匹配","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":96,"protein_g":3.41,"carbohydrate_g":20.98,"fat_g":1.5},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central · SR Legacy","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169999/nutrients","version":"SR Legacy 2019-04-01 / retrieved 2026-10-23","food_id":"169999"},"profile_id":"corn-yellow-boiled-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-853f4dcc16af","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_direct","match":{"food_identity":"yellow_sweet_corn","state":"cooked","cooking_method":"boiled_drained","edible_part":"kernels_without_cob_or_husk","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"plain_without_salt","excludes":["糯玉米、紫玉米或品种不明的玉米","生玉米、整根含芯称重","加糖、油、酱或其他配料的成品"]},"data_version":"11733c29f9eac874","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/corn-yellow-boiled-v1.df107a06a3224654.json","bytes":6127,"sha256":"df107a06a32246549a70cde08624af1fd28a9dcde5b1d1364861e985762a587c"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"corn-yellow-boiled-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-853f4dcc16af","recipe_blob_sha":"d6f46391d75e2fc662eba8023b2d6f4fbaeac178","version":"1","data_version":"11733c29f9eac874","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_direct","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"水煮黄色甜玉米的熟可食玉米粒，每100g沥水后重量；不含玉米芯、外皮、盐糖及油酱。仅在这些条件相符时使用。","match":{"food_identity":"yellow_sweet_corn","state":"cooked","cooking_method":"boiled_drained","edible_part":"kernels_without_cob_or_husk","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"plain_without_salt","excludes":["糯玉米、紫玉米或品种不明的玉米","生玉米、整根含芯称重","加糖、油、酱或其他配料的成品"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":96,"protein_g":3.41,"carbohydrate_g":20.98,"fat_g":1.5},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169999/nutrients","version":"11733c29f9eac874","fdc_ids":[169999]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":false,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/corn-yellow-boiled-v1.df107a06a3224654.json","bytes":6127,"sha256":"df107a06a32246549a70cde08624af1fd28a9dcde5b1d1364861e985762a587c"}}]}
